From 77b15dad0ddb37ae81b8f4550032745a196cadd5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alonso Walter Senen Roman Cauti <alonso.roman.c@uni.pe>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:53:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 43/44] feat(perf): add opt-in sampled EE guest-call profiler

Compile out all hooks by default. An explicit instrumented build and
PS2X_EE_PROFILE=1 sample one in 256 outer dispatches and nested guest
calls, reporting their entry/caller PCs and inclusive host CPU units.
Report bounded 120-field windows and EE thread CPU time without querying
a clock at every dispatch. Add aggregation, missing-clock and key-limit
tests. This is an O-03.2 diagnostic, not a gameplay optimization.

(cherry picked from commit 834f4965d6e5f8cc49f0fddedbc73e8ba9ed02f9)
